00:42:30,600 --> 00:42:31,780
There's the first layer.

762
00:42:33,300 --> 00:42:34,560
Here's the second coat.

763
00:42:35,040 --> 00:42:36,860
And then you have to let it dry for two minutes.

764
00:42:37,260 --> 00:42:39,720
With Dermabond, when you've sealed the wound,

765
00:42:39,721 --> 00:42:42,220
then you can have the patient shower.

766
00:42:42,380 --> 00:42:44,520
You're not worried about water getting into the wound.

767
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:50,400
Cyanoacrylates are also useful in the manufacture of medical

768
00:42:50,401 --> 00:42:52,600
equipment and small consumer devices.

769
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:55,880
In a precision manufacturing setting,

770
00:42:56,360 --> 00:42:57,760
the glue's strength is an asset,

771
00:42:58,200 --> 00:43:00,500
but its instant cure can be too quick.

772
00:43:01,360 --> 00:43:03,920
The solution is an innovative light cure technology.

773
00:43:04,760 --> 00:43:07,240
You can apply the adhesive to the surface,

774
00:43:07,700 --> 00:43:08,980
mate the two parts together,

775
00:43:08,981 --> 00:43:13,700
It will stay liquid until you shine an ultraviolet or a light on the surface.

776
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:19,720
This gives the end user flexibility for manufacturing and high-quality components.

777
00:43:20,600 --> 00:43:25,880
LightCure adhesives are tailored to polymerize at a specific wavelength of light.

778
00:43:26,280 --> 00:43:29,240
This is an example of an LED light source,

779
00:43:29,400 --> 00:43:33,020
which is predominantly putting out in the 405 nanometer wavelength,

780
00:43:33,360 --> 00:43:36,840
which correlates to the adhesive being used.

781
00:43:36,841 --> 00:43:40,440
Adhesives are found in other medical applications,

782
00:43:40,540 --> 00:43:43,320
like the transdermal patches that deliver nicotine

783
00:43:43,420 --> 00:43:46,020
and hormone therapies.

784
00:43:46,120 --> 00:43:49,080
Skin is one of the most phenomenally changing

